The handoff document is ready, with two versions:
- Web version: ⧉ edgeAgent GC-001 overall handoff. By default only you can open it; for the person taking over to view it, you need to share it with them via the Share menu on the page.
- Repo version: docs/proposals/HANDOFF-20261011.md, same content as the web version, already committed (05071cc), and added to the docs/proposals/README.md index.

The document covers the entire project, not just a single task:
- Current status and the top 3 urgent items;
- Constraints already set by the user;
- Architecture and call chain;
- Versions, SHAs, and rollback methods for each component on the board;
